<title>USA: JP Foodservice to buy Squeri.</title>
<headline>JP Foodservice to buy Squeri.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBIA, Md. 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>JP Foodservice Inc and Squeri Food Service Inc of Cincinnati said Wednesday they had signed a letter of intent providing for JP's acquisition of Squeri.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Squeri is an independent, broadline foodservice distributor serving the Greater Cincinnati, Dayton, Columbus, Indianapolis, Louisville and Lexington markets, a statement from JP Foodservice said.</p>
<p>Squeri, which is a family-owned and operated business, will continue to be managed by the Squeri family following the acqusition, the statement said.</p>
</text>
